  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> Pistols and SMGs not equipped with a Drum Magazine or Belt Box</p>\n<p><em>As most pistol-caliber weapons have their magazines embedded in their grip, getting around the issue of reloading requires more complex solutions, such as an integrated mechanical speed-loader.</em></p>\n<p>While the weapon’s magazine is empty, the user may expend their Move Action to Reload it without an Action. The Autoloader is then considered empty, and cannot be used again until until an Action is used to reset it. The weapon can still be reloaded normally with the Reload Action while the Autoloader is expended. Despite only requiring 1 Attachment Slot, this cannot be installed into a Magrail Kit.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to the From the Ashes LC for the basis of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Capacity &amp; Reloading).</em></p>"
